=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# firewall screen-moved-2230 -----------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: The Firewall screen. web-01.example.net runs Debian 13.$
# ufw active, allowing 22, sshd -T says 22, 2230 bound: ufw$
# refuses what accepts SSH, and ss doesn't say whose 2230 is, so$
# it gets no row. Enable refuses (decision 2).$
$
# UFW Firewall Configuration ###################################$
$
  [?] Firewall             Unknown ssh config not in effect$
$
# ufw ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Installed            Yes$
  [+] Status               Active$
  [+] Incoming policy      Deny$
  [+] At boot              Yes$
$
# SSH ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] [::]:22              Allowed Not bound$
  [ ] 0.0.0.0:22           Allowed Not bound$
  [ ] Bound sockets        None on SSH's ports$
$
# Rules --------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] 22/tcp               Allow$
  [+] 22/tcp (v6)          Allow$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Repair firewall      Refused here: select to see why$
   2) Application Profiles Add, remove, apply$
   3) Disable firewall     Stop ufw (not recommended)$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-3 or q]:$
$
$

